  "description": "Kiji is a static site generator framework for .NET. Pages are Razor components rendered to static HTML via HtmlRenderer and registered on a StaticSite. Includes a markdown content pipeline with YAML front matter, responsive WebP image optimization, RSS feed and sitemap artifacts, and a built-in on-demand dev server.",
